Z||000001||1FST2M6||08-23-2000||02:19 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> speed limiter 4cyl!...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  sorry... the limiter is in the E-prom of the ECU. At least on the 85-86 6s there is.. i'm sure like the 87-88s the limiters was disabled like the rev limiter...  <A HREF="http://www.superchips.com" TARGET=_blank>www.superchips.com</A>  or <A HREF="http://www.leaderind.com" TARGET=_blank>www.leaderind.com</A>  for an E-prom with out them... or <A HREF="http://www.nopi.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nopi.com</A>  (JET) ||||reg||1
