Z||000005||BroCar 87||08-24-2000||12:34 AM||||hey 1FST2m6, I only see the 2.8 (nopi : jet)<BR>application. I saw on the superchips webpage, that they were the same chip or module. Is that the case? Would I be able to put in a chip or module for the 2.8 in my 2.5??? <BR>Thanks for any feed back!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/NorthFLFieroSIG.jpg">  <BR>87 Coupe "IRON BEAST"<BR>84 SE (project)||||reg||1
