Z||000007||theogre||08-24-2000||12:20 PM||||That I know of there are NO chips for 2.5l motors with DIS ignition.<P>No. You can't put a V6 chip in a 4 cyl.<P>In all honesty I think GM may have intentionally under rated the DIS 4's. They've been known to do that allot. I'd love to see one of these on both an engine dyno and a drum rig. I'd like to see what they do with 195 and 180 thermostats in. It might not be much under rated but it'd be interesting to see what number come out.<P>I think the biggest thing limiting top speed with these is what gears are in the tranny. <p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 08-24-2000).]||||reg||1
